sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Browser A
  participant R as Referee API
  participant D as Database
  participant B as Browser B
  A->>A: Choose move; sample r; compute C; sign context
  B->>B: Choose move; sample r; compute C; sign context
  A->>R: POST /commit {C, signature, keyId}
  R->>D: Verify signature; store C
  B->>R: POST /commit {C, signature, keyId}
  R->>D: Verify signature; store C; enter REVEAL
  R-->>A: Phase notification
  R-->>B: Phase notification
  A->>R: POST /reveal {move, r}
  R->>D: Hold opening until second reveal
  B->>R: POST /reveal {move, r}
  R->>D: Verify both openings; resolve; append audit
  R-->>A: Public transcript
  R-->>B: Public transcript
  A->>A: Verify openings and signatures locally
  B->>B: Verify openings and signatures locally
